     </property>
     <property name="html">
      <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:138%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;docs-internal-guid-399596df-7fff-12b0-5bd1-5af297d7fa2a&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;n dieser Tabelle (wenn group = FALSE oder unbalanciert) gibt es für jedes Paar die Spalten &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:704; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;LCL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt; (Lower Confidence Limit) und &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:704; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;UCL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt; (Upper Confidence Limit).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:138%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:704; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;Praxis-Tipp zum Ablesen:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt; Die Differenz, ab der ein Paar signifikant wird (deine kriterienbezogene Grenzdifferenz für dieses Paar), entspricht genau dem Wert, den du von der echten Differenz abziehen oder dazuzählen musst, um auf die Konfidenzgrenzen zu kommen:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:138%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Google Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#1f1f1f; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;Grenzdifferenz für dieses Paar = difference - LCL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
     </property>
    </widget>
